<title>SPAIN: Cofir to hold 100 percent of NH Hotels.</title>
<headline>Cofir to hold 100 percent of NH Hotels.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish investment firm Corporacion Financiera Reunida (Cofir) said late on Tuesday it would buy the stake of NH Hoteles it does not already own.</p>
<p>&quot;Cofir and Antonio Catalan agreed that Cofir will assume control of 100 percent of NH Hoteles. In exchange Grupo Catalan will receive real estate from the chain, which will remain managed by NH chain,&quot; a statement explained.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
